<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01436#tard_strength> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A derogatory and offensive stereotype that falsely claims autistic individuals possess superhuman strength or invulnerability, often referred to as 'tard strength' (a slur derived from 'retard' or 'autistic' in a mocking context). This is a harmful and inaccurate concept that trivializes the real-world vulnerabilities of autistic people and perpetuates dangerous misinformation."@en .
