<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#Value> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One dimension embodying certain values versus another dimension embodying opposing values in memes, e.g. text and visuals representing conflicting moral or aesthetic values"@en .
