<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01436#autistic_person> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The concept of autism as a neurodevelopmental condition, often misunderstood or misrepresented in popular culture. The meme references autism in a harmful and inaccurate way, implying that autistic individuals possess superhuman strength or invulnerability, which is not true and can be dangerous. This stereotype misrepresents the lived experiences of autistic people and contributes to harmful narratives."@en .
