<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01436#mapping_001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text describes an autistic kid who is impervious to bullets due to 'tard strength'. This is analogically mapped onto the frog, which is visually depicted as resilient and unharmed by the implied bullet impact, creating a humorous juxtaposition. The frog's physical resilience is used to metaphorically represent the fictional 'tard strength' of the autistic person in the text."@en .
