<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01436#school_shooter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A person who commits a violent act at a school, often associated with mass shootings. This term refers to a real-world phenomenon that is tragically common in some societies, particularly in the United States. The meme uses this term to describe a fictional scenario, but it relies on the real-world understanding of school shootings to be understood."@en .
