<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01436#frog> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The central visual entity is a vividly colored tree frog, likely a red-eyed tree frog (Agalychnis callidryas), characterized by its bright green body, orange feet and toes, and large, prominent red eyes. It is perched dynamically on a pink, textured object, possibly a flower or artificial prop, with its limbs extended. The frog's appearance is highly saturated and visually striking, contrasting sharply with the blurred green background. Its posture and vibrant coloration make it the most salient visual element in the frame."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#descriptivelyAlignedWith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#verballyIronicalTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
