<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01436#frog_perched_on_object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The scene depicts a brightly colored tree frog perched dynamically on a pink, textured object, possibly a flower or artificial prop. The frog's limbs are extended, and its vibrant green body, orange feet, and large red eyes contrast sharply with the blurred green background. The frog is the central visual entity, positioned prominently in the frame."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#VisualMaterial> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Visual Material"@en .
