<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01436#violence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The use of physical force to harm or kill. The meme references violence in the context of a school shooting, which is a real-world phenomenon that is often tragic and traumatic. The juxtaposition of this violence with the frog's resilience is central to the meme's absurdity."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#contextuallyReferentAdjacentTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates text grouped near semantically related visual elements in memes"@en .
